        "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T17:54:12.823Z",
        "changeLog": "Faster Exterior loading and catalog browsing, especially with Exterior Studio, by avoiding repeated eligibility, outfit and inventory scans; convert animated GIF camouflage and projection-decal frames in one batch with improved converter shutdown and temporary-file cleanup; add animated Exterior Studio card and tooltip previews preserving every source frame and its timing, shared preview generation and resource cleanup; refresh the Studio catalog after custom-asset changes; hide empty internal style entries and keep uploaded assets out of editable-style configuration; allow valid owned or purchasable items through checkout while blocking only changed outfit items that cannot be applied server-side, including custom assets and incompatible combinations."
